  ('zzz-w-1189', 'zenless-zone-zero', 'Sed escarlata', 'Crimson Thirst', 'S', 'Armero', 'https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/Weapon_S_1611.webp', 'For as long as anyone can remember, tales and rumors about the Flint family have never ceased, enough to fill an entire anthology of rumors. Blood, Porcelloy, long-buried history, inherited miracles... None of these dangerous secrets have ever been fully laid bare, yet they have always held the public''s fascination. Curiously, the family head has never come forward to offer any explanation. Some say her ambitions reach too far for her to waste time on gossip. Some say she possessed a steady mind even in her youth and chose to let the rumors gather momentum. And some claim there were never any rumors about Flint to begin with, only truths passed down through the world. Rumors drift like fog, obscuring what is real and what is not. But toward that young family head, people feel nothing beyond reverence and fear.
"Roxy, the ruby in this W-Engine looks pretty valuable. If we sold it..." "Milady, forgive me for saying so, but I''m afraid it wouldn''t even cover the losses from a single meeting between you and Lady Lindverne."
—The family head struggling with a budget shortfall and her capable assistant', null, 431, null, 'DEF', '48%', 'Bloodthirst', '["The equipper''s CRIT Rate increases by 25%, and Electric DMG increases by 15%. When the equipper uses an EX Special Attack or triggers Maim, Electric Sharp DMG dealt increases by 10% for 40s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","The equipper''s CRIT Rate increases by 27.5%, and Electric DMG increases by 17.5%. When the equipper uses an EX Special Attack or triggers Maim, Electric Sharp DMG dealt increases by 11.5% for 40s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","The equipper''s CRIT Rate increases by 30%, and Electric DMG increases by 20%. When the equipper uses an EX Special Attack or triggers Maim, Electric Sharp DMG dealt increases by 13% for 40s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","The equipper''s CRIT Rate increases by 32.5%, and Electric DMG increases by 22.5%. When the equipper uses an EX Special Attack or triggers Maim, Electric Sharp DMG dealt increases by 14.5% for 40s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","The equipper''s CRIT Rate increases by 35%, and Electric DMG increases by 25%. When the equipper uses an EX Special Attack or triggers Maim, Electric Sharp DMG dealt increases by 16% for 40s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."]'::jsonb, 'Tirando en el canal exclusivo, cuando sale destacado', '[{"desde":10,"hasta":20,"creditos":12000,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer01.webp","cantidad":4}]},{"desde":20,"hasta":30,"creditos":28000,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer01.webp","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":30,"hasta":40,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero potenciado","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer02.webp","cantidad":20}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":100000,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero potenciado","icono":"h