  ('zzz-w-1191', 'zenless-zone-zero', 'Fortuna felina', 'Catty Luck', 'A', 'Armero', 'https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/Weapon_A_Common_17.webp', 'A specially modified W-Engine that''s become hugely popular on Inter-Knot. Some functionality was sacrificed for the sake of its appearance, but that hasn''t stopped it from becoming a massive hit.
