Unfortunately, each individual metric is slightly weaker than its predecessors, making it a precisely balanced "jack-of-all-trades" product that inspires both love and hate.', null, 282, null, 'DEF', '32%', 'Crescent Moon', '["When using an EX Special Attack, Basic Attack DMG increases by 18% for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","When using an EX Special Attack, Basic Attack DMG increases by 21% for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","When using an EX Special Attack, Basic Attack DMG increases by 24% for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","When using an EX Special Attack, Basic Attack DMG increases by 27% for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.","When using an EX Special Attack, Basic Attack DMG increases by 30% for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."]'::jsonb, 'Tirando en el gacha permanente · Tirando en los canales exclusivos y de amplificadores · Se vende en tiendas del juego', '[{"desde":10,"hasta":20,"creditos":7200,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer01.webp","cantidad":2}]},{"desde":20,"hasta":30,"creditos":16800,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer01.webp","cantidad":7}]},{"desde":30,"hasta":40,"creditos":36000,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero potenciado","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer02.webp","cantidad":12}]},{"desde":40,"hasta":50,"creditos":60000,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero potenciado","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer02.webp","cantidad":6}]},{"desde":50,"hasta":60,"creditos":120000,"materiales":[{"nombre":"Componente armero especializado","icono":"https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/zzz/WeaponRankArmorer03.webp","cantidad":12}]}]'::jsonb, null)
on conflict (id) do update
  set name = excluded.name,
      name_en = excluded.name_en,
      rarity = excluded.rarity,
      category = excluded.category,
      image_url = excluded.image_url,
      description = excluded.description,
      base_atk = excluded.base_atk,
      sub_stat_name = excluded.sub_stat_name,
      sub_stat_value = excluded.sub_stat_value,
      passive_name = excluded.passive_name,
      passive_levels = excluded.passive_levels,
      how_to_get = coalesce(excluded.how_to_get, public.weapons.how_to_get),
      ascension = excluded.ascension,
      good_for = coalesce(public.weapons.good_for, excluded.good_for),
      updated_at = now();

-- Comprobacion: 99 amplificadores, todos con icono, origen y materiales.
select count(*) as total,
       count(*) filter (where image_url is null) as sin_icono,
       count(*) filter (where how_to_get is null) as sin_origen,
       count(*) filter (where ascension is null) as sin_ascension
from public.weapons
where game_id = 'zenless-zone-zero';

select category, rarity, count(*) as amplificadores
from public.weapons
where game_id = 'zenless-zone-zero'
group by category, rarity
order by category, rarity;
